      "writtenOn": "2020-04-02T04:59:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Checking external behavior is good. And some decoupling of spec states from internal implementation details makes sense. But I think writing the states in comments instead of as a TEST_ASSERT is a missed opportunity to catch some more bugs.",
      "parentUuid": "3eab173b_4397091c",
